#502
guard captain Jessie~
Sir Jessie~
An important looking man is sitting here.~
He is dressed in light plate male, and has curly hair.He looks at
you as he notices that you are looking at him. He examines you
closely for a while and returns to his work.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
