150 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 8d1000+19000 1d1+499
100000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if armystatus($n) == 0
   say I am Sir Jessie, captain of the all mighty human army.
   say Are you here to join the army?
   look $n 
endif
~
>speech_prog p yes~
say Good, good. We could use more men like yaself son.
say Now, if you wish to join the army, type :
say " ARMY JOIN <ya password> "
say If you wishes to retire in the future, tell Matthius
say to bring you to me, then you may type :
say " ARMY RESIGN <ya password> " here to retire.
~
>speech_prog p no~
say I have no time for wimps like ya son!
say Guards! Remove this human junk from my sight!
mpechoat $n A few guards came and carried you out!
mptransfer $n 9755
~
|
#503
guard elite knight Gill~
Sir Gill~
A man who looks very strong is standing here.~
This man looks extremely strong and skillful. He is wears no armor
and wields no weapon. You notice that his fists are blood red, and
recalls a legendary fighter who had mastered an ancient martial art:
{110}The Fist of Flames{300} and knows no equal in the realms of the mortal.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
