>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,1,$n) == 0
  mpmset $n quest 0 1 1
  say Welcome to our ranks.
  say You might have been told that the enemies are weak,
  say but do not believe it else it may cost you your life.
  say Always watch your back ok?
  say Now here is a little something for you...
  mpoload 519
  drop all
  say It is a ranker and will tell you your rank in the army.
  say All you need to do is type "RANKING".
  say Have a nice day.
else
  say Hello $n
  smile $n
endif
~
