#520
A Guard Post~
Flames from the heart of the earth erupts beneath your feet, and it 
quickly surrounds you, leaving you no where to run! Strangely these
flames seem only to affect you, as if someone is controlling it! As you 
look around, searching for an exit, you notice that you are not alone.
Captain Matthius stares at you with a grin on his face. He than swings
his sword back and charges at you without even paying the slidest 
attention to the flames!~
